    "title": "42 patients under treatment at Aga Khan University Hospital for viral haemorrhagic fever",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "At Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH), 42 patients are currently hospitalized with suspect viral haemorrhagic fever; most of them were admitted during the last two weeks.",
